      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1772217347236,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Requirements\n\n1. An elevator system which contains multiple elevators and serves different \n floor of the buiding\n2. When user press elevator button from a floor, system should optimally assign\na elevator among all based on proximity and direction\n    - suppose a elevator is at floor 3 , 6 and user called an elevator at 4\n        - elevator at 3 floor should be assigned to user\n3. User can select floor in the elevator then elevator 4 should move to \nthat floor serving other users in the same direction. Consider elevator\ntake 1s to cross one floor\n\n4. System should support queuing request, concurrent request\n\n\nCore Entities\n\nElevatorSystem\nElevator\nElevatorRequest\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Requirements\n\n1. An elevator system which contains multiple elevators and serves different \n floor of the buiding\n2. When user press elevator button from a floor, system should optimally assign\na elevator among all based on proximity and direction\n    - suppose a elevator is at floor 3 , 6 and user called an elevator at 4\n        - elevator at 3 floor should be assigned to user\n3. User can select floor in the elevator then elevator 4 should move to \nthat floor serving other users in the same direction. Consider elevator\ntake 1s to cross one floor\n\n4. System should support queuing request, concurrent request\n\n\nCore Entities\n\nElevatorSystem\nElevator\nElevatorRequest\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
